{"id": "en_house_fire_p2", "total": 65.89, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Leo is safe outside, but his phone remains trapped inside the burning house.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.2}, {"text": "The urge to run back inside for his phone is dangerously strong right now.", "start": 4.74, "end": 7.86}, {"text": "One. Get out and stay out, because you must never go back inside ever.", "start": 7.672, "end": 12.1}, {"text": "Toxic smoke rises rapidly and can knock a person unconscious in just seconds flat.", "start": 12.72, "end": 16.2}, {"text": "Two. Call for help from outside instead of risking your life for an object.", "start": 15.91, "end": 20.18}, {"text": "Leo turns away from the flames and sprints toward his neighbor across the street.", "start": 20.9, "end": 23.62}, {"text": "He bangs loudly on the front door to wake the sleeping family inside immediately.", "start": 24.14, "end": 26.92}, {"text": "A neighbor answers the door quickly, sees the raging flames, and hands over a phone.", "start": 27.58, "end": 30.78}, {"text": "Three. Call for help right away while standing at a completely safe distance outside.", "start": 30.59, "end": 35.02}, {"text": "Leo speaks clearly to the emergency dispatcher and gives his exact street address instantly.", "start": 35.64, "end": 39.46}, {"text": "Behind him, the bedroom window shatters as bright orange fire engulfs the roof completely.", "start": 40.0, "end": 43.64}, {"text": "Closing the bedroom door earlier slowed the fire down, buying precious time for everyone.", "start": 44.28, "end": 47.64}, {"text": "The cleanest air was near the floor, which allowed his initial escape tonight.", "start": 48.16, "end": 50.88}, {"text": "Firefighters arrive on the scene fast with sirens echoing across the entire neighborhood.", "start": 51.56, "end": 55.02}, {"text": "Leo watches from safety knowing his quick thinking kept him completely unharmed tonight.", "start": 55.58, "end": 58.9}, {"text": "Get out, stay out, and call for help. Fol